{"4397180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Your Friend's Mom", "steam_appid": 4397180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4397320, 4397290, 4397300, 4397310, 4397330], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Friend's Mom</strong> — an interactive desktop companion with a built-in <strong>local LLM</strong> that roleplays as your friend’s mom. Place her anywhere on your desktop, customize her look, and chat about anything — from light small talk to longer conversations. On launch, the app randomly picks one of your Steam friends to set the context, and you can switch to a different one in the chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiyo 3D character by Cascadian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local LLM</strong> — on-device AI for more immersive roleplay conversations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam friend context</strong> — a random friend is chosen on launch; you can switch to a different one in the chat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat GUI</strong> — a clean and convenient interface for talking and interacting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse tracking</strong> — the 3D model follows your cursor and reacts to its movement. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move &amp; scale</strong> — drag your companion anywhere on the screen and resize her up or down. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outfits</strong> — 3 unique outfits to customize her style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poses</strong> — 16 unique poses you can switch anytime. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotions</strong> — 7 unique emotions to match the mood.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Friend's Mom</strong> — an interactive desktop companion with a built-in <strong>local LLM</strong> that roleplays as your friend’s mom. Place her anywhere on your desktop, customize her look, and chat about anything — from light small talk to longer conversations. On launch, the app randomly picks one of your Steam friends to set the context, and you can switch to a different one in the chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiyo 3D character by Cascadian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local LLM</strong> — on-device AI for more immersive roleplay conversations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam friend context</strong> — a random friend is chosen on launch; you can switch to a different one in the chat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat GUI</strong> — a clean and convenient interface for talking and interacting. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse tracking</strong> — the 3D model follows your cursor and reacts to its movement. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move &amp; scale</strong> — drag your companion anywhere on the screen and resize her up or down. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outfits</strong> — 3 unique outfits to customize her style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poses</strong> — 16 unique poses you can switch anytime. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotions</strong> — 7 unique emotions to match the mood.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Your Friend's Mom — a desktop companion with a local LLM, roleplaying as the mom of one of your Steam friends.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Japanese, Belarusian, Kazakh, Uzbek", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4397180/9c614cc9be49ac2b